    <Requirement id="ER-P094-02" level="1" requirementType="operation">
      <sysml:Name>膨胀水箱自动补水接口</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱应设置自动补水接口，当液位低于设定低位时，应能通过补水阀自动向水箱补水，直至液位恢复至正常范围。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P094" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-COMM-COOL-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-COMM-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>液位下降后无法自动补水，需人工干预，增加运维负担，可能延误恢复时间。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查设计图纸，确认设有自动补水接口及控制阀。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟低液位，确认自动补水阀开启并补水至正常液位，补水停止。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【膨胀水箱自动补水接口】，来自原始需求「自动补水接口」。E-COMM-COOL-001（调试程序）包含膨胀水箱液位检查（50-75%）和低液位报警验证，间接支撑自动补水功能；E-SUPP-COMM-001（调试核查清单）包含膨胀水箱液位检查，间接支撑。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
