    <Requirement id="ER-P094-03" level="1" requirementType="safety">
      <sysml:Name>冷却水泄漏蒸发应对</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱低位报警和自动补水接口应能有效应对冷却水泄漏或蒸发导致的液位下降，确保系统在正常工况下持续运行。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P094" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>系统无法自动应对冷却水损失，可能导致主机停机。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>通过设计审查确认低位报警和自动补水接口的联动逻辑满足泄漏蒸发应对要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟泄漏或蒸发工况，验证报警和补水功能正常。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却水泄漏蒸发应对】，来自原始需求「以应对冷却水泄漏或蒸发导致的液位下降」。E-SOLAS-COOL-001（SOLAS Reg.26）要求冷却系统异常报警，间接支撑应对泄漏蒸发的目的。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
